            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>Supplied with two powerful and reliable MX 24V 4.0Ah Lithium Ion batteries for a continuous mowing time of up to 120 minutes (one battery charging while the other is in use) and gardens of up to 300m2. Fast charging time of 60 minutes.</p>",
